WEBVTT

00:13:59.676 --> 00:14:01.876
different geographies, right?

00:14:01.876 --> 00:14:06.036
We want different studies
to point in the same direction.

00:14:06.036 --> 00:14:09.956
And that's why I'm here
and I can tell you with confidence,

00:14:09.956 --> 00:14:14.876
many studies point to all these same
benefits of relationships.

00:14:16.716 --> 00:14:20.756
WPR: And I know you touched
on the health element in your talk

00:14:20.796 --> 00:14:23.756
and shared that there is data
that reveals that we have --

00:14:23.756 --> 00:14:26.716
that there's a strong connection
between happiness and health.

00:14:27.196 --> 00:14:31.196
What have you specifically found
related to happiness and health outcomes?